{
  "name": "Macgyver Automações | Monitor de Site com Alerta (Uptime)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "minutes",
              "minutesInterval": 5
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "id": "33674efb-0389-49d5-b017-3b53d2df887a",
      "name": "TRG | A cada 5 min"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "duplicateItem": false,
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "1e55c5f1-ab10-4bd1-a75f-14988956c68f",
              "name": "app",
              "value": "site-monitor",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "dbf66902-927f-48dc-9386-2adbab6fe5e4",
              "name": "version",
              "value": "1.0",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "0be4e247-f27a-463f-aa98-709da15b6e44",
              "name": "siteUrl",
              "value": "https://seusite.com.br",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "bcb51c09-05eb-4062-a57f-3e45bdb0d1a8",
              "name": "siteName",
              "value": "Meu Site",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "b068c0b0-e086-4e08-9699-92f31ec91612",
              "name": "timeoutMs",
              "value": "10000",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "11a8987c-f34b-43b3-8eda-83f0b8582a6c",
              "name": "chatIdTelegram",
              "value": "__SEU_CHAT_ID__",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ],
      "id": "a3777b42-144e-40a7-bd17-fc3bf188d93b",
      "name": "CFG - Config"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ $json.siteUrl }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": "={{ $json.timeoutMs }}",
          "redirect": {
            "redirect": {
              "followRedirects": true
            }
          },
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "fullResponse": true
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ],
      "id": "c754f0ae-1849-4da0-b11c-5b5beb0f7db9",
      "name": "HTTP | Ping Site",
      "continueOnFail": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const cfg = $('CFG - Config').first().json;\nconst response = $input.first().json;\n\n// Check for error (timeout, DNS failure, etc)\nconst hasError = response.error || response.code === 'ETIMEDOUT' || response.code === 'ENOTFOUND';\nconst statusCode = response.statusCode || response.headers?.['status'] || 0;\nconst isDown = hasError || statusCode < 200 || statusCode >= 400;\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    isDown,\n    statusCode: statusCode || 'ERROR',\n    siteName: cfg.siteName,\n    siteUrl: cfg.siteUrl,\n    errorMessage: hasError ? (response.error?.message || response.message || 'Timeout/DNS') : null,\n    checkedAt: new Date().toISOString()\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        660,
        0
      ],
      "id": "e4f6617b-abda-4853-b22e-6245063d218d",
      "name": "FN | Avaliar Resposta"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": false,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "860d8791-7cfd-444e-9c5c-713ae3160bc8",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.isDown }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        880,
        0
      ],
      "id": "1a656bd3-0a83-4e01-a85f-a9a70cbc73d0",
      "name": "IF | Site Caiu?"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $('CFG - Config').item.json.chatIdTelegram }}",
        "text": "=🔴 *SITE FORA DO AR!*\n\n🌐 *Site:* {{ $json.siteName }}\n🔗 *URL:* {{ $json.siteUrl }}\n📊 *Status:* {{ $json.statusCode }}\n❌ *Erro:* {{ $json.errorMessage || 'Status HTTP inválido' }}\n⏰ *Checado em:* {{ $json.checkedAt }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "parse_mode": "Markdown"
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        1100,
        -60
      ],
      "id": "3aff2dbc-da62-4e88-bd2f-a6567db3f7d7",
      "name": "NTF | ALERTA Site Down → Telegram",
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "__CREDENTIAL_ID__",
          "name": "Telegram Bot"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1100,
        140
      ],
      "id": "264bf072-9bc3-4dd4-9a79-845cc5458a53",
      "name": "END | Site OK ✅"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🌐 Macgyver Automações | Monitor de Site (Uptime)\n\n**O que faz:** Pinga seu site a cada 5 min. Se cair (status != 2xx ou timeout), manda alerta no Telegram.\n\n**Como configurar:**\n1. Edite `CFG - Config`:\n   - `siteUrl`: URL completa do site\n   - `siteName`: nome amigável\n   - `timeoutMs`: timeout em ms (10000 = 10s)\n   - `chatIdTelegram`: seu Chat ID\n2. Configure credencial Telegram\n3. Ative o workflow!\n\n**Dica:** Duplique pra monitorar múltiplos sites.\n\n**Credencial:** Telegram Bot\n\n🔗 Macgyver Automações",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -280,
        -160
      ],
      "id": "178d20d9-f788-4872-9634-18c9af67b1e1",
      "name": "📋 Instruções"
    }
  ],
